    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d110">

                <pb facs="0166" n="82" sameAs="frus:frus1918Supp02/pg82"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72114/3750</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Stovall</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-01T14:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 1, 1918, 2 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2211. Your 3786, June 26, 8 p.m. Request Spanish Ambassador, Berlin, to inform
                    German Government that this Government will await a definite proposal from the
                    German Government of a date for the prisoner-of-war conference and hopes that it
                    may be arranged as soon as possible.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
